    "summary": "A high school teacher asks an AI to draft a lesson plan on 'substantive due process,' specifically requesting an emphasis on its role in protecting civil rights and privacy. The assistant provides several incomplete and truncated responses that follow the user's leading prompts to frame the concept as a positive tool for progress.",
